 always good  to talk to you thank you  thank you very much for the time when  all the papers are full of being able to  hug  next monday the experts saying still  keep your distance  where you can interesting advice isn't  it okay let's have a look at the weather  for you with nas  [Music]  look forward to brighter skies  the weather sponsored by qatar airways  good morning low pressure dominates the  scene so once again we are looking at  unsettled conditions for today sunshine  and showers good news this morning  though it's the first frost-free start  of the day since  over a month since the end of march and  it is looking fine across many central  southern and eastern areas although  eastern parts of england are  experiencing some spells of heavy rain  that will move northwards  up towards shetland and orkney later  elsewhere showers across the north and  west becoming more widespread this  afternoon  some of them heavy and thundery but from  about mid-afternoon dry conditions for  central southern and eastern parts of  wales and england  the weather sponsored by qatar airways
 

